# libubootenv configuration: fw_printenv and fw_setenv.
#
# Default, for the Zyxel GS1900. A board whose environment differs puts its
# own copy into files/<machine>/, where FILESOVERRIDES finds it first.
#
# The main environment of the stock Zyxel U-Boot (bootcmd, bootargs, ethaddr),
# the one its "printenv" shows. Geometry from OpenWrt's
# package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/realtek:
#   ubootenv_add_mtd "u-boot-env" "0x0" "0x400" "0x10000"
# mtd1 is "u-boot-env" in rtl8380_zyxel_gs1900.dtsi.
#
# The second environment in "u-boot-env2" (/dev/mtd2 0x0 0x1000 0x10000) holds
# "bootpartition", which selects between 0x260000 (0) and 0x930000 (1). Only
# slot 0 exists here, so it is deliberately not listed; it must read 0.
#
# Device	Offset	Size	Erase size
/dev/mtd1	0x0	0x400	0x10000
